  {
   "id": "two-ion-hamiltonian",
   "what": "激光中两个陷俘离子的哈密顿量",
   "source": "现代原子与光学物理 II，10.4 离子阱量子计算，10.4.1",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "tex": "\\hat{x} = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\hbar}{2\\km\\knu}}\\left(\\hat{a} + \\hat{a}^\\dagger\\right)",
       "src": "(10.2)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "{\\kH_{motion}} = {\\left(\\frac{\\kPcm^2}{2\\km} + \\frac{\\km}{2}\\knu^2 \\kXcm^2\\right)} + {\\left(\\frac{\\kpcm^2}{2\\km} + \\frac{\\km}{2}3\\knu^2 \\kxdisp^2\\right)}",
       "src": "(10.37)"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\kkmag\\kxdisp_{1,2}} = \\mk{R}{\\frac{\\kkmag}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\kXcm \\mp \\kxdisp)}",
      "src": "(10.33), (10.34)",
      "uses": [],
      "why": "把 (10.33) 与 (10.34) 相加和相减，得到$x_1$和$x_2$。"
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\kkmag\\kxdisp_{1,2}} = \\mk{R}{\\frac{\\kkmag}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hbar}{2\\km\\knu}}(\\hat{a}_{cm}+\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger) \\mp \\sqrt{\\frac{\\hbar}{2\\km\\knus}}(\\hat{a}_{s}+\\hat{a}_{s}^\\dagger)\\right)}",
       "uses": [
        0,
        1
       ],
       "cap": "(10.37) 的每个括号都是质量为$m$的振子，质心模式在$\\nu$，伸缩模式在$\\sqrt{3}\\nu$，所以 (10.2) 对每一个在各自的频率下成立。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\kkmag\\kxdisp_{1,2}} = \\mk{R}{\\eta_{cm}(\\hat{a}_{cm}+\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger) \\mp \\eta_s(\\hat{a}_{s}+\\hat{a}_{s}^\\dagger)}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "记$\\eta_{cm} = k\\sqrt{\\hbar/4m\\nu}$和$\\eta_s = k\\sqrt{\\hbar/4m\\sqrt{3}\\nu}$，这两个模式的兰姆-迪克参数。"
      }
     ],
     "note": "书中在 (10.39) 里使用了$\\eta_{cm}$和$\\eta_s$，但没有定义它们。用 (10.12) 的单离子参数$\\ketaLD = \\kkmag\\kazero$表示，$\\eta_{cm} = \\ketaLD/\\sqrt{2}$，$\\eta_s = \\ketaLD/(\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 3^{1/4}) \\approx 0.54\\,\\ketaLD$。"
    },
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "step": 0
      },
      {
       "tex": "{\\kH_{motion}} = {\\left(\\frac{\\kPcm^2}{2\\km} + \\frac{\\km}{2}\\knu^2 \\kXcm^2\\right)} + {\\left(\\frac{\\kpcm^2}{2\\km} + \\frac{\\km}{2}3\\knu^2 \\kxdisp^2\\right)}",
       "src": "(10.37)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kH_\\mathrm{motion} = \\hbar\\knu\\hat{a}^\\dagger\\hat{a}",
       "src": "(10.4)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kH_{int} = -\\sum_i\\left(\\hbar\\kDelta_i|e\\rangle_{ii}\\langle e| + \\hbar\\kOmega_i\\left(|e\\rangle_{ii}\\langle g|e^{i\\kkmag \\kxdisp_i} + h.c.\\right)\\right)",
       "src": "(10.38)"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{H}{\\kH} = \\mk{M}{\\kH_{motion}} + \\mk{I}{\\kH_{int}}",
      "src": "10.4.1",
      "uses": [],
      "why": "完整的哈密顿量是两个离子的运动及其与光的耦合。"
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{H}{\\kH} = \\mk{M}{\\hbar\\knu\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger\\hat{a}_{cm} + \\hbar\\knus\\hat{a}_s^\\dagger\\hat{a}_s} + \\mk{I}{\\kH_{int}}",
       "uses": [
        1,
        2
       ],
       "cap": "(10.37) 的每个模式都是一个振子，如 (10.4) 中那样为$\\hbar\\nu\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger\\hat{a}_{cm}$和$\\hbar\\sqrt{3}\\nu\\hat{a}_s^\\dagger\\hat{a}_s$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mk{H}{\\kH} = {} & \\mk{M}{\\hbar\\knu\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger\\hat{a}_{cm} + \\hbar\\knus\\hat{a}_s^\\dagger\\hat{a}_s} \\mk{D}{- \\sum_i\\hbar\\kDelta_i|e\\rangle_{ii}\\langle e|} \\\\ & \\mk{one}{-\\hbar\\kOmega_1\\left(|e\\rangle_{11}\\langle g|e^{i\\kkmag\\kxdisp_1} + h.c.\\right)} \\\\ & \\mk{two}{-\\hbar\\kOmega_2\\left(|e\\rangle_{22}\\langle g|e^{i\\kkmag\\kxdisp_2} + h.c.\\right)}\\end{aligned}",
       "uses": [
        3
       ],
       "map": {
        "I": [
         "D",
         "one",
         "two"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mk{H}{\\kH} = {} & \\mk{M}{\\hbar\\knu\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger\\hat{a}_{cm} + \\hbar\\knus\\hat{a}_s^\\dagger\\hat{a}_s} \\mk{D}{- \\sum_i\\hbar\\kDelta_i|e\\rangle_{ii}\\langle e|} \\\\ & \\mk{one}{-\\hbar\\kOmega_1\\left(|e\\rangle_{11}\\langle g|e^{i\\eta_{cm}(\\hat{a}_{cm}+\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger)}e^{-i\\eta_s(\\hat{a}_{s}+\\hat{a}_{s}^\\dagger)} + h.c.\\right)} \\\\ & \\mk{two}{-\\hbar\\kOmega_2\\left(|e\\rangle_{22}\\langle g|e^{i\\eta_{cm}(\\hat{a}_{cm}+\\hat{a}_{cm}^\\dagger)}e^{i\\eta_s(\\hat{a}_{s}+\\hat{a}_{s}^\\dagger)} + h.c.\\right)}.\\end{aligned}",
       "uses": [
